{"timestamp":"2026-06-10T15:09:44.417Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","call_id":"call_aKI3ktbuEBEZgBmVMgPYBROu","output":"Chunk ID: c14eab\nWall time: 25.1936 seconds\nProcess exited with code 0\nOriginal token count: 290\nOutput:\n[lint:shellcheck] $ ~/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/mise-tasks/lint/shellcheck\n[test:ci] $ go test -race ./...\n[lint:gofmt] $ ~/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/mise-tasks/lint/gofmt\n[test:phase1] $ ENTIRE_BRAIN_PHASE1_CI=1 go test -race ./internal/cli -run 'Tes…\n[lint:go] $ ~/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/mise-tasks/lint/go\n[build-all] $ for target in darwin/amd64 darwin/arm64 linux/amd64 linux/arm64 w…\n[lint:gomod] $ ~/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/mise-tasks/lint/gomod\n[lint:shellcheck] Finished in 347.6ms\n[test:phase1] ok  \tgithub.com/ashtom/entire-brain/internal/cli\t(cached)\n[test:phase1] Finished in 1.76s\n[lint:gomod] Finished in 4.36s\n[lint:gofmt] Finished in 4.73s\n[test:ci] ?   \tgithub.com/ashtom/entire-brain\t[no test files]\n[test:ci] ?   \tgithub.com/ashtom/entire-brain/cmd/entire-brain\t[no test files]\n[lint:go] Finished in 9.35s\n[lint] $ ~/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/mise-tasks/lint/_default\n[lint] Finished in 4.1ms\n[test:ci] ok  \tgithub.com/ashtom/entire-brain/internal/cli\t(cached)\n[test:ci] ok  \tgithub.com/ashtom/entire-brain/internal/config\t(cached)\n[test:ci] Finished in 9.95s\n[build-all] Finished in 25.20s\nFinished in 25.20s\n"}}
