{"timestamp":"2026-06-10T15:19:41.313Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"<subagent_notification>\n{\"agent_path\":\"019eb218-2e2a-7a82-9d0c-49f4e4597681\",\"status\":{\"completed\":\"**Bottom Line**\\nNo existing retained Radar agent suite can honestly be made proof-ready by audit-only/code-only changes. The only suite that is summary-proof-shaped is blocked by missing retained provenance/log evidence, and the newer `tool_result`-backed suites are behaviorally not clean. So: rerun needed for agent-lift proof.\\n\\nThe deterministic Radar tool-contract evidence does pass: `mise run radar:evidence` reports 37 required tests passing, but that is not agent lift proof.\\n\\n**Why Zero**\\nProof requires all of this in [audit_radar_evidence.py](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/benchmarks/agent-brain/audit_radar_evidence.py:352): stable summary proof, n>=4 each side, Radar pass rate 1.0, no-brain headroom, then audit backing with MCP verified + named tool + completed `tool_result` at [audit_radar_evidence.py](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/benchmarks/agent-brain/audit_radar_evidence.py:441).\\n\\nThe missing policy issue is real retained-record absence: [audit_codex.py](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/benchmarks/agent-brain/audit_codex.py:209) only trusts `provenance.task.radar_include_deletions`, and [evidence/release/README.md](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/release/README.md:28) says the audit must not infer it from mutable task files.\\n\\n**Key Suites**\\n`audit-backing-gap`:\\n`benchmarks/agent-brain/results/release-candidate-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-deletions-all-loci-rerun-20260610Tprogress`\\nSummary says proof-ready: 4x4, no-brain `0.25` -> Radar `1.00`. But all 4 Radar records have `radar_include_deletions: null`; logs have `tool: brain_regressions` but no `tool_args` / `tool_result`. Needs rerun, not audit relaxation.\\n\\n`promotable-audit-gap`:\\n`benchmarks/agent-brain/results/pilot-radar-manual-attribution-location-screen-20260610Tprogress`\\nOne-run headroom: `0.00` -> `1.00`, but n=1 and same old missing policy/result backing. Needs committed n>=4 rerun.\\n\\n`brain-not-clean` newer tool-result suites:\\n`release-candidate-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-deletions-tool-result-20260610T115718Z`\\n`release-candidate-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-deletions-tool-result-rerun-20260610T122500Z`\\nBoth have clean `tool_args` / `tool_result` backing, but Radar pass rate is `0.75`, not `1.00`.\\n\\n`release-candidate-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-deletions-behavior-tool-result-20260610T130500Z`\\nRadar pass rate `0.75`; one run lacks the required tool call.\\n\\n`release-candidate-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-tool-args-20260610T1415Z`\\nNo-brain is saturated at `1.00`, Radar is `0.50`, and records still miss embedded deletion policy.\\n\\n**Run Next**\\nFor a real rerun candidate:\\n\\n```sh\\nsuite=\\\"release-candidate-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-deletions-$(date -u +%Y%m%dT%H%M%SZ)\\\"\\npython3 benchmarks/agent-brain/run.py panel release-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-deletions \\\\\\n  --suite-name \\\"$suite\\\" \\\\\\n  --pricing-file benchmarks/agent-brain/pricing.json\\n```\\n\\nThen audit only that suite:\\n\\n```sh\\ntmp=\\\"$(mktemp -d)\\\"\\npython3 benchmarks/agent-brain/audit_codex.py \\\\\\n  --results benchmarks/agent-brain/results \\\\\\n  --suite-glob \\\"$suite\\\" \\\\\\n  --out-dir \\\"$tmp\\\" \\\\\\n  --fail-on-flags \\\\\\n  --min-suites 1 \\\\\\n  --min-records 8 \\\\\\n  --min-proof-ready 1 \\\\\\n  --min-mcp-verified 4 \\\\\\n  --min-mcp-named-tool-verified 4\\n\\npython3 benchmarks/agent-brain/audit_radar_evidence.py \\\\\\n  --results benchmarks/agent-brain/results \\\\\\n  --suite-glob \\\"$suite\\\" \\\\\\n  --out-dir \\\"$tmp\\\" \\\\\\n  --codex-audit-report \\\"$tmp/codex-audit-report.json\\\" \\\\\\n  --fail-when-no-proof\\n```\\n\\nRelevant hidden validation from [entireio-cli-radar-manual-attribution-deletions.json](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/benchmarks/agent-brain/tasks/entireio-cli-radar-manual-attribution-deletions.json):\\n\\n```sh\\ngo test ./cmd/entire/cli/strategy -run 'TestPostCommit_NoTrailer_UpdatesBaseCommit|TestPostCommitNoTrailerRealignsAttributionBaseHidden' -count=1\\n```\\n\\nLocal checks after any audit/harness change:\\n\\n```sh\\npython3 benchmarks/agent-brain/run_test.py\\nmise run radar:screen\\nmise run radar:evidence\\nmise run radar:agent-evidence\\n```\\n\\nNote: `radar:agent-evidence` currently fails with “Radar evidence has no proof-ready comparison,” which matches the audit. Also, by final check the live workspace showed unrelated modifications to `run.py` / `run_test.py` and one fresh baseline-only incomplete suite; I did not edit files.\"}}\n</subagent_notification>"}]}}
