{"timestamp":"2026-06-10T15:45:58.281Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","call_id":"call_dvEfMe1HMO1puzo2d8ymYJAt","output":"Chunk ID: 70afa2\nWall time: 0.0000 seconds\nProcess exited with code 0\nOriginal token count: 500\nOutput:\nusage: run.py run [-h] [--tasks [TASKS ...]] [--agents AGENTS]\n                  [--runners RUNNERS] [--conditions CONDITIONS]\n                  [--repetitions REPETITIONS]\n                  [--stop-after-no-brain-score STOP_AFTER_NO_BRAIN_SCORE]\n                  [--timeout TIMEOUT] [--agent-retries AGENT_RETRIES]\n                  [--claude-budget CLAUDE_BUDGET]\n                  [--pricing-file PRICING_FILE] [--pricing-json PRICING_JSON]\n                  [--checkpoint-limit CHECKPOINT_LIMIT]\n                  [--suite-name SUITE_NAME] [--keep-worktrees]\n                  [--no-brain-cache] [--refresh-brain-cache]\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n  --tasks [TASKS ...]\n  --agents AGENTS\n  --runners RUNNERS     Comma-separated runner specs: agent[:model[:effort]]\n                        or id=agent[:model[:effort]]. Overrides --agents.\n  --conditions CONDITIONS\n  --repetitions REPETITIONS\n  --stop-after-no-brain-score STOP_AFTER_NO_BRAIN_SCORE\n                        After the first no_brain repetition for a task/runner,\n                        skip the remaining repetitions and conditions if the\n                        score is above this threshold.\n  --timeout TIMEOUT\n  --agent-retries AGENT_RETRIES\n                        Retry explicit transient agent-capacity/service\n                        failures\n  --claude-budget CLAUDE_BUDGET\n                        Claude max budget in USD; 0 disables the cap\n  --pricing-file PRICING_FILE\n                        JSON price map for estimated cost when the agent does\n                        not report cost\n  --pricing-json PRICING_JSON\n                        Inline JSON price map for estimated cost when the\n                        agent does not report cost\n  --checkpoint-limit CHECKPOINT_LIMIT\n  --suite-name SUITE_NAME\n  --keep-worktrees\n  --no-brain-cache      Rebuild brain prep artifacts in every run\n  --refresh-brain-cache\n                        Overwrite cached brain prep artifacts\n"}}
