Radar repetitions on this task; screen a harder target/source history |\n| pilot-radar-transcript-reresolve-low-screen-20260610Tprogress | entireio-cli-transcript-reresolve | codex-gpt-5.4-mini-low | early_stop | score 97 > 85 | n/a | no-brain-too-easy | do not spend Radar repetitions on this task; screen a harder target/source history |\n| release-candidate-entire-cli-workspace-radar-mcp-transcript-reresolve-haiku-xhigh-20260610T154230Z | entireio-cli-transcript-reresolve | claude-haiku-xhigh | early_stop | score 89 > 85 | n/a | no-brain-too-easy | do not spend Radar repetitions on this task; screen a harder target/source history |\n| pilot-radar-base-scope-current-n4-20260610Tprogress | entireio-cli-review-base-flag-scope | codex-gpt-5.4-mini-medium | incomplete | n/a | n/a | incomplete-suite | rerun or regenerate the suite summary before citing Radar evidence |\n| release-candidate-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-20260610Tprogress | entireio-cli-manual-commit-attribution-base | codex-gpt-5.4-mini-medium | incomplete | n/a | n/a | incomplete-suite | rerun or regenerate the suite summary before citing Radar evidence |\n| release-candidate-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-deletions-calibrated-radar-tool-result-20260610T135500Z | entireio-cli-radar-manual-attribution-deletions | codex-gpt-5.4-mini-low | incomplete | n/a | n/a | incomplete-suite | rerun or regenerate the suite summary before citing Radar evidence |\n| release-candidate-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-deletions-calibrated-tool-result-20260610T133500Z | entireio-cli-radar-manual-attribution-deletions | codex-gpt-5.4-mini-low | incomplete | n/a | n/a | incomplete-suite | rerun or regenerate the suite summary before citing Radar evidence |\n| release-candidate-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-deletions-context-tool-result-20260610T124500Z | entireio-cli-radar-manual-attribution-deletions | codex-gpt-5.4-mini-low | incomplete | n/a | n/a | incomplete-suite | rerun or regenerat