yK7/codex-audit-report.json and codex-audit-report.md\nPASS release:evidence\n==> mise run radar:evidence\n[radar:evidence] $ tmp=\"$(mktemp -d)\"\n# MCP/Radar Tool Evidence Audit\n\n- Status: **PASS**\n- Claim scope: **mcp_radar_tool_contract**\n- Required tests: **48**\n- Artifact: `go-test-internal-cli-radar.jsonl`\n- Artifact hash: `sha256:0b7c853f6e8fa27df68851b07f10a083e60eff64b1b5952ed0934509be35ced1`\n- Package pass event: **True**\n\n## Limitations\n- Tool-contract proof only; this is not agent lift proof.\n- Recent release-candidate Radar agent panels were saturated or noisy on no-brain baselines and are not retained as pass-rate proof.\n- This artifact proves local deterministic MCP/Radar behavior for the current internal/cli test fixtures.\n\nWrote /var/folders/wb/5flrfjsj0px0nc4tvnbkxrhc0000gn/T/tmp.aTbHZyP6p9/radar-tool-audit-report.json and radar-tool-audit-report.md\nPASS radar:evidence\n==> mise run distill:evidence\n[distill:evidence] $ manifest=\"benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/distill-perf/man…\n# Distill Performance Evidence Audit\n\n- Status: **PASS**\n- Release evidence: **true**\n- Target: **github.com/ashtom/entire-brain**\n- Claim scope: **current-repo local command-agent distill extraction scheduling speedup**\n- Required speedup: **1.25x**\n- Observed speedup: **1.9961447767232992x**\n- Dry-run chunks: **159**\n\nWrote /private/var/folders/wb/5flrfjsj0px0nc4tvnbkxrhc0000gn/T/tmp.Hle7Yoi31c/distill-perf-audit-report.json and distill-perf-audit-report.md\nPASS distill:evidence\n==> mise run facts:evidence\n[facts:evidence] $ manifest=\"benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/facts-eval/manifes…\n# Facts Eval Evidence Audit\n\n- Status: **PASS**\n- Release evidence: **true**\n- Claim policy: **no_release_claim**\n- Facts-vs-raw claimable: **false**\n- Tasks hash: `unset`\n- Brain manifest hash: `unset`\n- Required retrievers: none\n\nWrote /private/var/folders/wb/5flrfjsj0px0nc4tvnbkxrhc0000gn/T/tmp.zrxLyrSt37/facts-eval-audit-report.json and facts-eval-audit-report.md\nPASS facts:evidence\n==> mise run semantic:evidence\n[semantic:evidence] $ tmp=\"$(mktemp)\"\nexit status 1\nsemantic audit: freshness=unsafe files=140 symbols=2463 relations=17783 blind_spots=0\nsemantic audit axis head: stale\nsemantic audit axis worktree: dirty-unindexed semantic index is based on committed HEAD\n[semantic:evidence] ERROR task failed\nFAIL semantic:evidence (exit 1)\nrelease readiness failed: semantic:evidence\n[release:readiness] ERROR task failed\n"}}
