{"timestamp":"2026-06-10T16:46:10.787Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","call_id":"call_AoWpnlTjSTmVJZ3RcYH7Y75E","output":"{\"status\":{\"completed\":\"**Audit Result**\\nRetained distill-performance evidence is already healthy for its narrow claim. I ran:\\n\\n```sh\\nmise run distill:evidence\\ngo test ./internal/cli -run 'TestRunDistillForBrainParallelExtractionMatchesSerial|TestExecOllamaDistillAgent|TestDistillDryRun|TestRunDistillForBrainReportsDistillEvidence'\\npython3 benchmarks/agent-brain/run_test.py DistillPerfAuditScriptTests\\n```\\n\\nAll passed. `mise run distill:evidence` reports release evidence true for current-repo command-agent scheduler proof, `159` chunks, and `1.996x` observed speedup.\\n\\n**What’s Done**\\n- Dry-run is implemented in [internal/cli/distill_cmd.go](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/internal/cli/distill_cmd.go:656) via `buildDistillDryRunReport`, with CLI handling at [internal/cli/distill_cmd.go](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/internal/cli/distill_cmd.go:264).\\n- Timing JSON is implemented in [internal/cli/facts.go](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/internal/cli/facts.go:42) and populated in [internal/cli/distill_cmd.go](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/internal/cli/distill_cmd.go:623).\\n- `--jobs` extraction is parallelized but committed deterministically through ordered result consumption in [internal/cli/distill_cmd.go](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/internal/cli/distill_cmd.go:934) and deterministic fact writes in [internal/cli/facts.go](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/internal/cli/facts.go:243).\\n- Ollama loopback runner is implemented in [internal/cli/distill_cmd.go](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/internal/cli/distill_cmd.go:1361), with proxy bypass, redirect checks, and loopback-only dialing.\\n\\n**Remaining Gaps**\\n- No production dry-run or `--jobs` determinism gap found.\\n- Current retained evidence in [benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/distill-perf/manifest.json](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/distill-perf/manifest.json:1) proves only “current-repo local command-agent distill extraction scheduling speedup,” not real Ollama latency or a large frontend repo.\\n- Smallest code/test gap: Ollama is well tested at the runner level, but not through the full `entire brain distill --agent ollama --model ... --json` command path. Also `injectAgentModel` lacks an explicit Ollama assertion.\\n\\n**Lowest-Risk Next Patch After Radar/MCP**\\nMake it test-only unless a test exposes a bug:\\n\\n1. Add an Ollama case to `TestInjectAgentModel` in [internal/cli/distill_test.go](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/internal/cli/distill_test.go:305).\\n2. Add `TestDistillCommandOllamaLoopbackProducesTimedSummary` in [internal/cli/distill_cmd_test.go](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/internal/cli/distill_cmd_test.go:1594):\\n   - create a temp brain with `writeDistillFixtureAt`\\n   - serve `/api/generate` with `httptest`\\n   - set `ENTIRE_BRAIN_OLLAMA_URL`\\n   - run `distill --agent ollama --model llama3.2 --json --force --jobs 2`\\n   - assert request model/system/prompt, non-streaming, no PATH `ollama`, and JSON summary has `agent`, `model`, `jobs`, `effective_extraction_jobs`, call counts, and timing fields.\\n\\nRun after patch:\\n\\n```sh\\ngo test ./internal/cli -run 'TestDistillCommandOllamaLoopbackProducesTimedSummary|TestInjectAgentModel|TestExecOllamaDistillAgent'\\ngo test ./internal/cli\\nmise run distill:evidence\\n```\\n\\nWorktree note: `docs/release_readiness_audit.md` is currently modified with an unrelated MCP/Radar test-count change (`44` to `47`); I did not edit or revert it.\"}}"}}
