{"timestamp":"2026-06-10T17:04:59.023Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call","name":"spawn_agent","namespace":"multi_agent_v1","arguments":"{\"agent_type\":\"explorer\",\"fork_context\":true,\"message\":\"You are auditing the entire-brain repo for remaining QMD compatibility release blockers. Do not make code changes. Focus on CLI/MCP QMD-aligned verbs: search, vsearch, query, get, multi-get, flags like --format json|cli, -n, --limit, --json, and branch behavior. Inspect current code/tests/docs and return: (1) any P0/P1 blockers with file:line refs, (2) missing tests that would let regressions pass, (3) low-risk fixes to recommend. The main thread is continuing locally, so avoid overlapping implementation. No network, no PR/push.\"}","call_id":"call_8H00iqRsEupOH8m5Job2Whof"}}
