tire-brain/docs/release_readiness_audit.md:611).\\n   - Smallest close: run the same immutable proof-labeled task file through `facts`, `history`, `query`, and `raw-sessions`; retain the four `facts eval --json` summaries and `facts eval-compare --json` for raw-vs-facts.\\n\\n**P1 Blockers**\\n\\n3. **Proof labels must be real, not source-match smoke**\\n   - CLI docs say source-session labels are proxy/smoke unless judged/refined: [facts_eval.go](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/internal/cli/facts_eval.go:353).\\n   - `eval-compare` rejects non-proof relevance sources unless proxy mode is explicitly enabled: [facts_eval_compare.go](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/internal/cli/facts_eval_compare.go:405).\\n   - Auditor requires proof labels and rejects proxy promotion: [audit_facts_eval.py](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/benchmarks/agent-brain/audit_facts_eval.py:436).\\n   - Smallest close: use human or `judge_refined` labels on the task set; do not use `--allow-proxy-comparison` for release proof.\\n\\n4. **The proof manifest/report must replace the no-claim manifest**\\n   - `mise run facts:evidence` only validates committed reports and fails if stale: [mise.toml](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/mise.toml:160).\\n   - Proof mode requires canonical retrievers, matching hashes, no missing IDs, claimable/significant metric, and facts beating raw: [audit_facts_eval.py](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/benchmarks/agent-brain/audit_facts_eval.py:298), [audit_facts_eval.py](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/benchmarks/agent-brain/audit_facts_eval.py:469).\\n   - Smallest close: replace `manifest.json` with proof-required entries, run `mise run facts:evidence:update`, then `mise run facts:evidence`.\\n\\nChecks run:\\n- `mise run facts:evidence` passed as no-claim evidence.\\n- `go run ./cmd/entire-brain facts status --json` and `--all-branches` both showed zero facts.\\n- `python3 benchmarks/agent-brai