ribution-deletions__codex-gpt-5.4-mini-low__mcp_history__r1/mcp-server.log:9).  \\n   Audit says `4/4` named/completed overall, but only **3** clean condition records where **4** are required: [codex-audit-report.json](/var/folders/wb/5flrfjsj0px0nc4tvnbkxrhc0000gn/T/tmp.WNPFWkFRug/codex-audit-report.json:6063).\\n\\n2. `...deletions-tool-result-20260610T115718Z`  \\n   Same shape: good MCP proof, bad clean pass-rate. Summary says `candidate_proof_ready: false`, `proof_ready: false`, pass-rate `0.00 -> 0.75`, `brain_validation_not_clean`: [summary.json](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/benchmarks/agent-brain/results/release-candidate-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-deletions-tool-result-20260610T115718Z/summary.json:16), [summary.json](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/benchmarks/agent-brain/results/release-candidate-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-deletions-tool-result-20260610T115718Z/summary.json:64), [summary.json](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/benchmarks/agent-brain/results/release-candidate-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-deletions-tool-result-20260610T115718Z/summary.json:90).  \\n   The failed Radar rep is `mcp_history__r2`: `validation_passed: 1`, score `69`: [record.json](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/benchmarks/agent-brain/results/release-candidate-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-deletions-tool-result-20260610T115718Z/entireio-cli-radar-manual-attribution-deletions__codex-gpt-5.4-mini-low__mcp_history__r2/record.json:478). Audit backing again has only **3** clean condition records vs required **4**: [codex-audit-report.json](/var/folders/wb/5flrfjsj0px0nc4tvnbkxrhc0000gn/T/tmp.WNPFWkFRug/codex-audit-report.json:5556).\\n\\n3. `...deletions-all-loci-rerun-20260610Tprogress`  \\n   This is statistically the strongest, but the MCP proof binding is old/incomplete. Summary says `candidate_proof_ready: true`, `proof_ready: true`, pass-rate `0.25 -> 1.00`, `verdict: brain_positive`: [summary.json](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/benchmarks/agent-brain/results/release-candidate-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-deletions-all-loci-rerun-20260610Tprogress/summary.json:16), [summary.json](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/benchmarks/agent-brain/results/release-candidate-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-deletions-all-loci-rerun-20260610Tprogress/summary.json:64), [summary.json](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/benchmarks/agent-brain/results/release-candidate-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-deletions-all-loci-rerun-20260610Tprogress/summary.json:90).  \\n   But server logs only show `tool: brain_regressions`; they lack `tool_args` and `tool_result`: [mcp-server.log](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/benchmarks/agent-brain/results/release-candidate-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-deletions-all-loci-rerun-20260610Tprogress/entireio-cli-radar-manual-attribution-deletions__codex-gpt-5.4-mini-low__mcp_history__r1/mcp-server.log:8). The record also lacks `task.radar_include_deletions`; compare absence after task path here: [record.json](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/benchmarks/agent-brain/results/release-candidate-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-deletions-all-loci-rerun-20260610Tprogress/entireio-cli-radar-manual-attribution-deletions__codex-gpt-5.4-mini-low__mcp_history__r1/record.json:397).  \\n   Audit flags all four Radar records with `H:provenance_missing_radar_include_deletions_policy`, `B:mcp_radar_server_missing_location_only`, and `B:mcp_required_tool_results_missing(brain_regressions)`: [codex-audit-report.md](/var/folders/wb/5flrfjsj0px0nc4tvnbkxrhc0000gn/T/tmp.WNPFWkFRug/codex-audit-report.md:110). The comparison then gets `G:proof_ready_without_*` flags: [codex-audit-report.md](/var/folders/wb/5flrfjsj0px0nc4tvnbkxrhc0000gn/T/tmp.WNPFWkFRug/codex-audit-report.md:114).\\n\\n**Smallest Honest Path**\\n\\nDo **not** fix the auditor or promote the manifest from these artifacts. The auditor is catching real gaps: either unclean Radar reps or missing server/provenance proof.\\n\\nSmallest honest path is a fresh rerun of the existing deletion panel at current HEAD, then promote only if it has both clean lift and named/result-backed MCP proof:\\n\\n```bash\\npython3 benchmarks/agent-brain/run.py panel \\\\\\n  release-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-deletions \\\\\\n  --suite-name release-candidate-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-deletions-tool-result-current-20260610TXXXXZ\\n```\\n\\nThen audit that suite with `audit_codex.py` plus `audit_radar_evidence.py --fail-when-no-proof`. If it gets 4 clean Radar condition records, server `tool_args` with `location_only/include_deletions`, `tool_result`, and non-saturated pass-rate lift, then retain it and update the release manifest.\"}}"}}
