{"timestamp":"2026-06-10T17:39:23.636Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","call_id":"call_EKIDDE2QAer7E1dI3EQX0g2D","output":"{\"status\":{\"019eb1c9-d797-73e1-a3cb-cd83ff65795d\":{\"completed\":\"Fastest honest path: **rerun the existing panel** `release-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-deletions`. I would not design a new task first.\\n\\nWhy this lane: it is already a fair Radar/MCP setup: `codex:gpt-5.4-mini:low`, `no_brain` vs `mcp_history`, `BENCH_RADAR_LOCATION_ONLY=1`, 4 reps, hidden expected/validation, deletion-aware task metadata. See [panel](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/benchmarks/agent-brain/panels/release-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-deletions.json:4) and [task](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/benchmarks/agent-brain/tasks/entireio-cli-radar-manual-attribution-deletions.json:10).\\n\\nWhy no-brain should not saturate: prior runs on this exact task/runner show no-brain pass rates `0.00`, `0.25`, `0.25`, `0.50`, `0.75`, never `1.00`. The strongest old run was `0.25 -> 1.00`, but lacked current `tool_args/tool_result` proof. Newer tool-result runs had clean MCP proof but one failed Radar rep each: `0.00 -> 0.75` and `0.25 -> 0.75`.\\n\\nCurrent HEAD supports the rerun: focused Go checks passed for all-deletion-loci Radar and safe MCP logging, and benchmark audit tests passed for deletion args / named `tool_result` proof.\\n\\nI would not spend time on these first:\\n- `review-file-count`: already saturated `1.00 -> 1.00`.\\n- `transcript-reresolve`: saturated / no-brain-too-easy.\\n- `attribution-realign-state`: saturated.\\n- medium manual-attribution Radar: slower and noisy/negative in release runs.\\n\\n**Run Candidate**\\n\\n```bash\\nsuite=\\\"release-candidate-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-deletions-tool-result-$(date -u +%Y%m%dT%H%M%SZ)\\\"\\n\\npython3 benchmarks/agent-brain/run.py panel \\\\\\n  release-entire-cli-radar-mcp-manual-attribution-deletions \\\\\\n  --suite-name \\\"$suite\\\" \\\\\\n  --timeout 1800 \\\\\\n  --agent-retries 1\\n```\\n\\nEstimated runtime: historical agent time is about **11.5-13.5 minutes** for the 4 paired reps; expect roughly **20-30 minutes wall-clock** with prep, validation, and variance.\\n\\n**Gate It**\\n\\n```bash\\ntmp=\\\"$(mktemp -d)\\\"\\n\\npython3 benchmarks/agent-brain/audit_codex.py \\\\\\n  --results benchmarks/agent-brain/results \\\\\\n  --suite-glob \\\"$suite\\\" \\\\\\n  --out-dir \\\"$tmp\\\" \\\\\\n  --fail-on-flags \\\\\\n  --min-suites 1 \\\\\\n  --min-records 8 \\\\\\n  --min-proof-ready 1 \\\\\\n  --min-mcp-verified 4 \\\\\\n  --min-mcp-named-tool-verified 4 \\\\\\n  --min-repetitions-per-side 4\\n\\npython3 benchmarks/agent-brain/audit_radar_evidence.py \\\\\\n  --results benchmarks/agent-brain/results \\\\\\n  --suite-glob \\\"$suite\\\" \\\\\\n  --out-dir \\\"$tmp\\\" \\\\\\n  --codex-audit-report \\\"$tmp/codex-audit-report.json\\\" \\\\\\n  --fail-when-no-proof\\n```\\n\\nPass threshold: `no_brain` must stay below `1.00`, Radar must be `1.00`, summary `proof_ready: true`, zero hard flags, and 4/4 MCP records must have server `tool`, safe `tool_args` with `location_only/include_deletions`, and `tool_result`.\\n\\n**Promote If It Passes**\\n\\nRetain the suite under `benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/release/$suite/`, keeping `summary.json`, `records.ndjson`, per-run `record.json`, and `mcp-server.log`.\\n\\nThen update:\\n- [manifest.json](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/release/manifest.json:6): bump minimums to include the new suite/8 records/1 proof/4 MCP named records.\\n- Add `mcp_radar_location_only` to `required_proof_scopes` and `required_named_tool_proof_scopes`.\\n- Update [README.md](/Users/suhaan/Documents/Coding/entire-brain/benchmarks/agent-brain/evidence/release/README.md:61) from “no retained Radar agent-lift” to the new retained proof.\\n\\nFinal gates:\\n\\n```bash\\nmise run release:evidence:update\\nmise run release:evidence\\nmise run radar:agent-evidence\\nmise run radar:screen\\n```\\n\\nNo files edited, no PR/push.\"}},\"timed_out\":false}"}}
