dence:sessions/s.jsonl:1 rankBoost:1}]\n303:test (windows-latest)\tRun go test ./...\t2026-06-10T17:39:08.5130814Z --- FAIL: TestRegressionAssignmentDeletionRelatedLocationsStayOnSameInvariant (0.00s)\n305:test (windows-latest)\tRun go test ./...\t2026-06-10T17:39:08.5139952Z --- FAIL: TestRegressionAssignmentDeletionRelatedLocationsDistinguishSameIdentifierDifferentRHS (0.00s)\n306:test (windows-latest)\tRun go test ./...\t2026-06-10T17:39:08.5143454Z     regression_test.go:426: expected resolved and fallback deletion findings, found resolved=false fallback=false anomalies=[{File:pkg\\resolve_transcript.go Line:4 Kind:deleted Current:_ = state.TranscriptPath Expected:state.TranscriptPath = resolved Identifier:transcriptpath Symbol:missResolved RelatedLocations:[] Confidence:0.65 Reason:history asserts `state.TranscriptPath = resolved` in this hinted file, but that assignment is absent at this current locus Evidence:sessions/s.jsonl:1 rankBoost:1} {File:pkg\\resolve_transcript.go Line:9 Kind:deleted Current:_ = state.TranscriptPath Expected:state.TranscriptPath = fallback Identifier:transcriptpath Symbol:missFallback RelatedLocations:[] Confidence:0.65 Reason:history asserts `state.TranscriptPath = fallback` in this hinted file, but that assignment is absent at this current locus Evidence:sessions/s.jsonl:1 rankBoost:1}]\n307:test (windows-latest)\tRun go test ./...\t2026-06-10T17:39:08.5146728Z --- FAIL: TestRegressionAssignmentDeletionDoesNotLetIntactSiblingMaskRHSOnlySite (0.00s)\n308:test (windows-latest)\tRun go test ./...\t2026-06-10T17:39:08.5148726Z     regression_test.go:443: expected missing RHS-only assignment site in miss, got [{File:pkg\\resolve_transcript.go Line:8 Kind:deleted Current:resolved := compute() Expected:state.TranscriptPath = resolved Identifier:transcriptpath Symbol:miss RelatedLocations:[] Confidence:0.65 Reason:history asserts `state.TranscriptPath = resolved` in this hinted file, but that assignment is absent at this current locus Evid